    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Randomly sample many wild species across clades, maintain them under comparable domestication for the same number of generations, and compare standardized heritable variance with established domestic progenitors. Comparable mean variance would support the prediction.";
